  "protocol": "One sequential observation per listed configuration. Fresh server for each observation. Warmup uses the final eight archive IDs for eight greedy outputs. Measured requests use unpadded native input IDs, zero cached tokens, temperature 0, seed 42, ignore_eos, one slot and 64 returned token IDs. TTFT uses client monotonic time from HTTP request to first SSE token. Live decode TPS is 63 divided by seconds between the first and last token. Only detail runs enable FLASH_SCALING_COUNTERS=1. Clean runs use the same diagnostic binary with the counters and verification profiler disabled. ATOMIC_WINDOW_PROFILE confirms the actual streamed prompt block sizes. OS file cache and thermals uncontrolled. High water is process-lifetime managed engine memory.",
